          <msContents>
            <summary>Note-book containing receipts for alchemical and chemical processes, medical prescriptions, etc. In German and Latin: with additions by several hands. A few small roughly executed pen-drawings of alchemical apparatus, etc. The name of Kann appears on fol. 3v, 19v, 21, 31 and 32v. On fol. 148 is the signature of 'Ludwig Fischart' of Brunswick, dated 1646, by a later hand than that of the rest of the MS.</summary>
            <textLang mainLang="" source="IANA">German</textLang>
